
This directory contains a little bit modified version of
libbzip2 Version 1.0.8 of 13 July 2019.

- blocksort.c is OMITTED (not merely unbuilt): BZ2_blockSort has
 no call site anywhere in the tree, and the seven helpers it
 defines (mainSort/mainQSort3/mainSimpleSort/mainGtU/
 fallbackSort/fallbackQSort3/fallbackSimpleSort) are referenced
 only from inside blocksort.c itself.  It was ~11 KB of
 unreachable code in the DLL.  Defining XACRETT_BZ_COMPRESSION
 will now fail loudly with LNK2001 instead of silently
 misbehaving, which is the point.

- randtable.c must STAY: decompress.c expands BZ_RAND_UPD_MASK
 -> BZ2_rNums for randomised blocks, so it is on the decode
 path, not the encode path.

- Since the compression stuff is not required for XacRett,
 some files are omitted from original libbzip2 archive and
 some lines of codes are commented by #ifdef XACRETT_BZ_COMPRESSION.
